# Screenshots and Evidence

This folder contains screenshots captured during the Windows Desktop Support & Troubleshooting Lab.

The screenshots provide visual evidence of practical troubleshooting activities performed on a Windows 11 Pro computer.

## Evidence Included

- Network connectivity testing using `ping 8.8.8.8`.
- DNS resolution testing using `nslookup google.com`.
- Windows system information and performance monitoring.
- Additional troubleshooting activities as the project progresses.

## Purpose

The screenshots support the troubleshooting reports by showing the commands executed and the results obtained during each test.

## Privacy and Security

All screenshots must be reviewed before publication. Personal information, usernames, private network details, and other sensitive information should be removed or obscured where necessary.

## Note

This is a personal learning project created to demonstrate practical IT Support, Technical Support, and troubleshooting skills.
